edits_description = "Only the tree was cropped out."
final_image_tex = SubResource("Resource_bwnms")
province = 35
blurb = "The warrior Taira no Tadanori seated beneath a cherry tree.

Brother to the head of the Taira clan, Tadanori was a general in the Genpei War fought against the Minamoto. Upon his death in the Battle of Ichi-no-Tani, a poem was discovered in his quiver:

Were I, still traveling as night falls,
to make a sheltering tree my inn,
then would my host tonight be the blossoms themselves?"
